<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1065" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγχόν-η</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strangling, hanging</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγχόνης . . τέρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					746
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα κρείσσον᾽ ἀγχόνης</span>
			deeds too bad for <i>hanging</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1374
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάδ᾽ ἀγχόνης πέλας</span> 'tis
			nigh as bad as <i>hanging</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				246
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτ᾽ οὐχὶ . . ἀγχόνης ἔστ᾽ ἄξια</span>”
				<i>;</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					246
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα . . οὐκ ἀ.</span>”
				<i>;</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					125
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δ᾽ ἀγχόνην ἥψαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Semon.
					1.18
				</span></i>
			: rare in Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ λύπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.38
				</span></i>
			:— in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀγχόναις θάνατον λαβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					200
				</span></i>
			, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				154
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μάλιστα τοῖς νέοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					954b35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανδραγόρα</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.75
			</span></i>.</div>
